# Local Environment Configuration (CLAUDE.local.md)

Copy this file to `CLAUDE.local.md` and customize for your environment.
CLAUDE.local.md is gitignored and contains environment-specific PII.

## Network Configuration

### IP Addresses
| Service | IP |
|---------|-----|
| Gateway | 192.168.x.1 |
| Hypervisor | 192.168.x.x |
| NAS | 192.168.x.150 |
| Control Plane VIP | 192.168.x.x |
| Control Plane 1 | 192.168.x.x |
| Control Plane 2 | 192.168.x.x |
| Worker 1 (GPU) | 192.168.x.x |
| Worker 2 | 192.168.x.22 |
| Worker 3 | 192.168.x.23 |
| LoadBalancer Pool | 192.168.x.x-z |
| Traefik Static IP | 192.168.x.x |

### Hostnames
| Service | Hostname |
|---------|----------|
| Domain | example.com |
| Proxmox | proxmox.example.com |
| TrueNAS | truenas.example.com |
| ArgoCD | argocd.example.com |
| Grafana | grafana.example.com |

## Hardware

### GPU Configuration
- Model: NVIDIA Quadro P2200
- Node: worker-1
- PCI passthrough enabled

### Storage
- TrueNAS Pool: RAIDZ3
- Raw Capacity: ~x TB

## Credentials Paths

### 1Password Vault Paths
- `op://homelab/sops-age-key/private_key` - SOPS encryption key
- `op://homelab/truenas-api-key/credential` - TrueNAS API key
- `op://homelab/cloudflare-api-token/credential` - Cloudflare DNS token

### Local Files
- `~/.op/op_service_account_token` - 1Password service account
- `~/.config/sops/age/keys.txt` - Local SOPS key (for development)
